{"id":"1cc8976a-11c2-4553-9f45-ca55321e0e73","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"5d4956212c0a06c2","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/github-auth.ts","baseline":{"blob":"a81f4a539db0b50985892db1624669dae9721e7c","start":0,"end":52},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","{","isProduction",",","PRODUCTION","}","from","\"","./address","\""]},"context":{"after":"4f3cff290b6f145a"}},"payload":{"text":"The auth-provider seam — the ONE layer between \"who am I to GitHub\" and everything that talks to GitHub.\n\nA provider is nothing more than a `fetch` that guarantees a valid `Authorization: Bearer`. That's the whole\ncontract, and it's the shape the problem forces regardless of library: `@octokit/*` calls it an `authStrategy`,\n`@badgateway/oauth2-client` ships `OAuth2Fetch` (which already IS such a fetch), and `fido` consumes it as its\n`fetch` option. So the PAT→App swap later (see the deferred `appProvider` note) is a one-liner — github.ts\ndownstream only ever knows \"a fetch\".\n\nLives SHELL-side on purpose: the token stays in the top frame. The workbench iframe and any (sandboxed) game\niframe never receive a GitHub client — they traffic in files (zen-fs), not tokens.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:47:15.198Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:47:15.198Z"}
{"id":"4d18fa64-c665-4bb4-b30e-1fd3b52b90e4","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"67951fadee675054","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/github-auth.ts","baseline":{"blob":"5518d4cade4a98f8ccfe9033f475b0db23aa7650","start":1680,"end":1684},"shape":{"type":"Block","atoms":["{","}"]},"context":{"before":"1c9b640eb0c4db5c","after":"e56f0c45e3c28c6a"}},"payload":{"text":"storage off: nothing was kept","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:47:14.442Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:47:14.442Z"}
{"id":"8929b80c-0525-4f32-bb4e-30d55c9ef9aa","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"8767874c972ecfcf","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/github-auth.ts","baseline":{"blob":"91576a746f87f62dbed1f1d483a712ce828a5311","start":994,"end":1136},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","const","GITHUB_APP_INSTALL","=","`","https://github.com/apps/","${","isProduction","(",")","?","PRODUCTION",".","app",":","\"","unusually-good-editor-dev","\"","}","/installations/new","`"]},"context":{"before":"4f3cff290b6f145a","after":"257e79f54cb530b0"}},"payload":{"text":"Where a signed-in user chooses the repositories the editor's GitHub App (production's, or the dev one) may reach.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:47:14.873Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:47:14.873Z"}
{"id":"cc86a491-7804-439d-a31d-941579871f80","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"257e79f54cb530b0","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/github-auth.ts","baseline":{"blob":"569434fdb76b0c632f7a295cbe39e0a5aa184758","start":1260,"end":1320},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","RETIRED_KEYS","=","[","\"","shell:githubPat","\"",",","\"","shell:githubRepo","\"","]"]},"context":{"before":"8767874c972ecfcf","after":"47e75c59cafe5e55"}},"payload":{"text":"Where the retired pasted PAT was kept, and the retired record of the repo the workspace was loaded from (the\nworkspace's own origin says that now: `git.origin`): deleted on load, so neither outlives what replaced it.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:47:14.705Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:47:14.705Z"}
{"id":"f3b2085f-8476-4c27-99cd-e30e82106684","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"4f3cff290b6f145a","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/github-auth.ts","baseline":{"blob":"2a0636f589f90e2d87984ec4d74eb2102832b82f","start":866,"end":905},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","type","AuthProvider","=","typeof","fetch"]},"context":{"before":"5d4956212c0a06c2","after":"8767874c972ecfcf"}},"payload":{"text":"A provider is a fetch that attaches a valid credential (or, signed out, none).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:47:15.037Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:47:15.037Z"}
{"id":"f99bc51a-02b5-4515-9df0-5fc146d6b6c1","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"e56f0c45e3c28c6a","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/shell/github-auth.ts","baseline":{"blob":"1cd4b7f9cb45d8ae1c20a1e961cca815a6b0b701","start":1726,"end":1808},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","interface","RepoBinding","{","\"","owner","\"",":","string",";","\"","repo","\"",":","string",";","\"","branch","\"",":","string","}"]},"context":{"before":"47e75c59cafe5e55"}},"payload":{"text":"The GitHub repository the workspace is a clone of, and the branch it's on: where a commit pushes.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:47:14.267Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:47:14.267Z"}
